<title>UK: Heathrow bellyhold dominates UK freight traffic.</title>
<headline>Heathrow bellyhold dominates UK freight traffic.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo carried in the bellyhold of passenger planes using London's Heathrow airport accounted for accounted for 54 percent of all UK air cargo in 1996 or a fractionally higher percentage than the previous year, annual Civil Aviation Authority's (CAA) data shows.</p>
<p>Freight carried in cargo planes grew by six percent or double th4e rate at which bellyhold traffic increased in 1996.</p>
<p>Details of the CAA data in thousands of tonnes include</p>
